# data/interim/ — preprocessed/intermediate data files
# All files here are gitignored. Examples:
#   part_a.parquet   — part A of fraudTrain (first 80%)
#   part_b.parquet   — part B (next 10%, calibration)
#   part_c.parquet   — part C (last 10%, threshold)
#   tune_sub.parquet — tuning subsample of A
#   compare_sub.parquet — comparison subsample of A (disjoint from tune_sub)
